# Generated PBR source maps. `scripts/generate_textures.py` and `generate_graphics.py` produce
# these deterministically from fixed seeds, and `scripts/build_venue.py` bakes them into
# public/models/diplomatic_hall.glb (which IS committed). Tracking ~21 MB of regenerable
# binaries would bloat history for nothing. Re-create them with `npm run textures`.
# The booth pop-up posters are the exception: src/main.js fetches those over HTTP.
textures/*
!textures/booth_*_screen.png
